    "highlights": "No explicit illustrative text highlights (like brush strokes or markers) were found. The design relies strictly on standard CSS properties like underlines (`.underline`, `.decoration-gray-500`), subtle gradient text, and weight variations for emphasis.",
    "insights": [
      "A highly structured and explicit numerical naming convention is used for typography classes (e.g., `.text-heading-64`, `.text-copy-16`, `.text-label-12`), directly mapping semantic intent to specific size/line-height pairs.",
      "Headings uniquely employ a custom font weight of `450` across most sizes (16px to 72px), giving titles a confident, refined presence that sits perfectly between standard regular (400) and medium (500) weights.",
      "The system integrates `Geist Mono` heavily as a secondary typeface, deploying it for utilitarian labels, technical badges, code references, and microcopy to underscore the brand's developer-centric identity."
    ]
  }
